[{"title":"孙蜚莪邹石可过集","author":"郭之奇","text":"雨后诛茅径，春云湿草堂。\n一樽供笑语，五马动辉光。\n酒赋忘忧馆，啸闻在水方。\n稍迟花席上，更醉月中觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35206,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西园清事清韵","author":"郭之奇","text":"西园新橘柚，东壁旧松云。\n木石能相友，禽鱼遂作群。\n栽花泥入袖，灌菜水沾裙。\n日暮无他事，独酌起微醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35207,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家别慈闱　庚午冬北征作","author":"郭之奇","text":"隐忍竟成去，今从膝下分。\n密缝如母见，齧指令儿闻。\n繇此燕天雪，相参粤岭云。\n征衣空湿尽，夙夜尚殷殷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35208,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过隘岭","author":"郭之奇","text":"连峰称隘岭，仄径俯汀山。\n晓日开林杪，晴烟入岫弯。\n羊肠三十里，鸟道百重间。\n叹息云深处，终成孔道颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35209,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雩都登舟","author":"郭之奇","text":"山色还依袖，棹歌已入桅。\n家从云岭去，人向雪江来。\n暮霭千林出，寒烟一抹开。\n离心迷近远，望眼正徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35210,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庐陵阻风晚泊","author":"郭之奇","text":"阴曀日飘发，悠悠折客程。\n凄深林壑气，淡泊水天情。\n寒雾依江暮，霜华逐浪生。\n思家寻梦早，可奈旅魂惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35211,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦徐九一邀游虎丘坐千人石上待月联吟觉来枕上偶记数联似五言律也","author":"郭之奇","text":"晚露华山□，游情绝世根。\n千秋川泽气，三载粤吴魂。\n古月今相对，新诗近孰尊。\n沉吟收夜色，歌啸辟天门。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35212,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"然不忆何语出何人矣残灯馀几雨雪霏雱有怀耿然依韵追足","author":"郭之奇","text":"莫逆交之橐，有怀梦亦根。\n游神通历览，盟性启精魂。\n静觉文心一，孤存夙约尊。\n远思劳寐接，春雪乱吴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35213,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读肃之诗","author":"郭之奇","text":"探意出声始，而神忽逗之。\n理于玄引绪，情以静专思。\n浑漠人天籁，宁关笔墨司。\n掀髯披韵刻，此际孰相窥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35214,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病腕","author":"郭之奇","text":"臂与閒为狃，腕因不受调。\n徐从书纠旷，还借药降骄。\n甘苦惟神剂，浅深亦意料。\n未能知手舞，肱枕或馀饶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35215,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊所见","author":"郭之奇","text":"落日逶迤去，丹霞宛转轻。\n山深千树绿，月泻一湖清。\n澄澹繇宽蓄，空濛自远横。\n微风天汉过，仍曳彩云生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35216,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挂席过南浦","author":"郭之奇","text":"水力惟风竞，高帆出晓阴。\n西山飞鸟过，南浦落花深。\n雾重千林影，舟轻万里心。\n会看龙跃处，直向剑江寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35217,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月晕","author":"郭之奇","text":"丹霞组锦幕，金魄累瑶官。\n景合诸星拱，灵生两曜通。\n重轮初引象，太极始辉空。\n圆明欣相覆，身依末照中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35218,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阴暮","author":"郭之奇","text":"晴阴云日抱，薄暮水霞争。\n近远分山异，浅深授客清。\n黄鹂依树绿，白鹭点溪明。\n微出三春韵，各因一物情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35219,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"农圃","author":"郭之奇","text":"春霖谁见德，独向圃农家。\n山集云雷隘，岸倾陇亩斜。\n微闻泉脉动，欲令远心遐。\n植杖何人者，优游语种瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35220,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚望","author":"郭之奇","text":"微风传窈谷，细雨到平沙。\n岸色迎垂柳，波文卷落花。\n云林深愈绿，山卉薄能华。\n野意来无尽，青烟叠晚涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35221,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春汀","author":"郭之奇","text":"扁舟时一望，云水入春汀。\n淡泊如孤性，凄清就远坰。\n沙喧争汲女，波动款飞蜓。\n随意花风起，悠然动渚馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35222,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊攸镇","author":"郭之奇","text":"跂远日悠悠，聊从一苇谋。\n心微迎鸟语，意适俯鱼游。\n暮雨仍相续，前滩未可柔。\n灭明村火出，孤缆向昏投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35223,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上滩","author":"郭之奇","text":"弱缆从奔濑，一滩破一心。\n身随鸥鸟泛，歌动水龙吟。\n偶尔惊涛及，难因短棹禁。\n每怀川涉意，因此益临深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35224,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕","author":"郭之奇","text":"受风因下上，裔水自差池。\n日渚留形薄，春洲递语卑。\n处堂恋主德，渡海赴鹏期。\n漫有深林在，无心借一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35225,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑞金寇警","author":"郭之奇","text":"青春犹水国，粉堞见流民。\n扰扰居行色，飘飘旦暮身。\n自为万里客，每念四方人。\n安得春陵作，凄然此地陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35226,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨过隘岭口占","author":"郭之奇","text":"细雨千山内，轻云万木坰。\n钩连从灭没，屈折落青冥。\n仰胁舒心目，交襟抱影形。\n藏身真隘岭，何处是前汀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35227,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊上杭界","author":"郭之奇","text":"山深依树峡，溪转见柴门。\n鸟雀逢人语，牛羊与牧喧。\n澌流无静势，芳麓有微痕。\n一苇相依倚，薜萝尚可扪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35228,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨泊鲟鱼村隔舟讯杨承之　癸酉北征舟中作","author":"郭之奇","text":"寂寞江村处，连绵风雨时。\n招邀无一事，闻问各何思。\n玄草君成否，危言我亦为。\n消閒差此胜，分手共成诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35229,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚望雷发","author":"郭之奇","text":"披窗舒望眼，向夕屡徘徊。\n雨点穷春日，江声动晚雷。\n苍茫烟水去，历乱电光来。\n看取满盈意，羁怀倏与开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35230,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日雨望计春","author":"郭之奇","text":"九旬春序六，万里客程三。\n一水云光湿，千山雨鬓毵。\n桃花红未了，柳色绿相参。\n何处愁心数，惊时祇自憨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35231,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊皖江走笔讯方肃之","author":"郭之奇","text":"三载过君再，依依一水盈。\n诗从传处尽，绪自问时生。\n以我春江约，听君雨谷声。\n书行仍引领，目极片云争。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35232,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀陆山甫","author":"郭之奇","text":"思君何处起，回首岭云深。\n祖帐披胸语，灯前顾影吟。\n阮生馀白眼，季子尽黄金。\n徒将一杯酒，为余万里心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35233,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽斋偶成","author":"郭之奇","text":"素几明幽独，盆花为客公。\n娇纭晴日霭，氲燠暮春风。\n心定迎喧寂，窗虚受色空。\n午云檐际落，亦向此冲融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35234,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客路","author":"郭之奇","text":"青春归白水，岐路忆同人。\n所畏莺声老，还愁马背新。\n长途难屡计，幽事颇宜亲。\n近识杨花意，飘摇念客身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35235,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新暑","author":"郭之奇","text":"炎帝司初令，高云散碧端。\n恒旸方与助，新暑遂难宽。\n去鸟惟依树，来人未解鞍。\n所愁芳草歇，谁念客途单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35236,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午车","author":"郭之奇","text":"远道收春尽，轻车破夏来。\n晴岚归远树，燠霭散平莱。\n永昼光初嚇，午云倦不开。\n凉薰虽可悦，畏日亦长哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35237,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨意","author":"郭之奇","text":"雨意分朝暮，山容合近遥。\n褰帷惟鸟见，倚轼亦云招。\n乍令红尘退，还疑碧草骄。\n长途争此刻，赢得我歌谣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35238,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邹滕道中喜连日密云细雨","author":"郭之奇","text":"始见青山色，依依向远人。\n炎光能稍逊，景物倍堪亲。\n悦性开蝉籁，披襟动客神。\n堤花垂晓露，归色尚疑春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35239,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后晓发夹沟驿","author":"郭之奇","text":"云轻龙意倦，雨宿鸟声阑。\n晓袖浮芳润，轻蹄印草乾。\n尘光愁欲放，曙色幸犹跚。\n望里青梅落，应为渴者酸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35240,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过桃山岳武穆祠愤感再成","author":"郭之奇","text":"忠以冤馀愤，冤奇愤莫寻。\n杀臣君不意，报国子同心。\n血泪金牌湿，丹铭涅背深。\n身亡和计就，悬眼恨留今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35241,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自徐州渡河途中寻春即见有感","author":"郭之奇","text":"江南春一片，河北渺难寻。\n马首迷昏霭，羁怀滞远林。\n莺疲歌易涩，柳细叶难阴。\n惟有枝头杏，千花慰独心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35242,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"所思","author":"郭之奇","text":"风尘春不让，况复久游身。\n懒困花谁主，迷离草似人。\n劳心空就远，周道每怀新。\n渺渺林烟际，所思欲具陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35243,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见孟尝养士及叔孙演礼故碑","author":"郭之奇","text":"时雄因客重，曲学表君尊。\n义市齐公子，礼传汉叔孙。\n两生终莫致，三窟竟何存。\n寂寞荒碑在，徒贻识者论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日暮迷途赖初月得至新嘉","author":"郭之奇","text":"烟林西照入，东望似薰春。\n竟日无啼鸟，终风独傲人。\n疲心销永昼，迷路赖初轮。\n细细轻弦出，微光念远身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东平晓望","author":"郭之奇","text":"春光惟晓际，花柳暂逢迎。\n嫩绿殊轻薄，妖红遂满盈。\n凄清从汶水，烂熳及东平。\n幽事初关切，风尘莫骤惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东阿晓望见雨后春色心目为之一开","author":"郭之奇","text":"旅绪终无极，花光亦有初。\n含情窥远道，连类见群居。\n细细朝菲缀，依依晓艳舒。\n幽园殊衬帖，春色任亲疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨宿","author":"郭之奇","text":"雨宿花光重，风浮草色轻。\n转添莺欲语，更觉柳摇情。\n碧野真如洗，烟林复与清。\n欣欣群物意，相对愧劳生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将至荏平见雷风大作","author":"郭之奇","text":"鼓动雷风职，方春振百凋。\n群生俱有待，万汇各相翘。\n久客甘濡滞，饥农欲悴憔。\n自悲仍虑物，心折任飘摇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮轺见归鸟有感","author":"郭之奇","text":"群飞俱一息，日入故林招。\n自惜羽毛瘁，兼防牖户漂。\n如何万里客，不及一枝鹩。\n俯首惭诸翼，悠悠促暮轺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哀东人三首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"岂不重乡井，其如转壑沟。\n携持相死救，离散或生偷。\n幸未沦胡虏，犹当仰喔咻。\n须臾喘息计，黾勉一箪求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哀东人三首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"东人亦孔痗，饥馑接疮痍。\n兵后荒常必，黎馀旱易欺。\n何臣容节矫，无地可民移。\n万里萧条客，分餐欲济谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哀东人三首 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"救荒政十二，省薄首相教。\n无骨供输挽，何心积厩庖。\n鸿飞看在野，鼠食问谁郊。\n所叹求刍牧，依然向斗筲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见诸邑遍立粥厂高旗旗书抚院明文饥者之口果及粥乎否也","author":"郭之奇","text":"独怜疮补计，今下肉糜文。\n巧妇炊谁见，邦人谷未闻。\n群哺非易合，中饱竟难分。\n自古流图绘，何时达圣君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饥者毙于荒而有不尽以荒毙者催科抚字当并计矣二首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"狗彘皆人食，衣冠半茧丝。\n君无尤旱魃，民已失春时。\n考未阳城署，都非孔距为。\n如何饥馑故，独使旰宵思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饥者毙于荒而有不尽以荒毙者催科抚字当并计矣二首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"未易言蠲赈，庶几别旧新。\n用三离父子，取一足君民。\n经国前贤训，哀时独我陈。\n空谈何补切，或可助仁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寂寂","author":"郭之奇","text":"寂寂芳郊色，纷纷孔道颜。\n炎凉虽异地，清浊自殊班。\n彼结幽人侣，此为达者关。\n客心殊异迹，车马亦云山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野色","author":"郭之奇","text":"野色来天地，春怀动古今。\n云从生及止，烟自浅为深。\n接瞬穷诸变，哀时抚寸阴。\n生涯从此问，更作远游心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月二日再补客司二首 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"将母来生事，惟寅夙夜心。\n常存非孝意，以著服官箴。\n寂寞时犹昨，艰虞道弥深。\n作忠求寸补，何地可浮沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月二日再补客司二首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"莫道含香旧，依然束带初。\n中原方羽檄，四海尚车书。\n典属虽无似，和容庶有馀。\n圣朝收敝帚，犹诏锦窠居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋前一日有七闽督学之命","author":"郭之奇","text":"雪峰初入望，旗鼓旧相扶。\n观察当年相，考亭百代儒。\n一官仍己学，吾道未邻孤。\n叹息高山在，谁能隔步趋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有感","author":"郭之奇","text":"十年玄尚白，知我自寥寥。\n养拙诗书际，藏身礼乐朝。\n何心皋北近，每叹指南遥。\n此意含终古，时人那可料。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坚坐","author":"郭之奇","text":"一室分晨暮，空庭秋气敲。\n露凝天汉冷，风动斗枢摇。\n纵目来潇旷，虚心对泬寥。\n悠悠长夜袭，坚坐遂中宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"爽色","author":"郭之奇","text":"燕舍忽成秋，梧风就客愁。\n俄传声憭慄，渐觉气高浮。\n霜薄朝花耐，天空晚雁悠。\n月明西岭对，爽色尽皇州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"散馆得春曹未补","author":"郭之奇","text":"六载藜灯倦，三秋兰署深。\n红颜吹短鬓，白眼愧华簪。\n坐对浮云变，时忧末路沉。\n闻弦应欲坠，按剑复何心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"解嘲","author":"郭之奇","text":"少小怀孤尚，浮名那足贪。\n遇禽羞获十，分栗任朝三。\n已笑书空拙，更深愿外惭。\n虽云不晓事，遮莫解嘲谙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长叹","author":"郭之奇","text":"摇落秋风日，低徊万古心。\n青云悲短翮，白雪怅孤吟。\n懒复呼升斗，终须问尺寻。\n当年初服在，长叹未抽簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35267,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"补主客司有提督二馆之差","author":"郭之奇","text":"礼乐从君子，车书尽远人。\n献方无异物，典属有微臣。\n咫尺阶前近，要荒万里邻。\n从兹诸服外，谁敢不尊亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35268,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贡使杂沓至馆","author":"郭之奇","text":"重译归中国，咸宾及四门。\n正仪思足法，束带自能言。\n表饵非吾术，柔怀属圣恩。\n须知干羽地，观耀莫齐论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35269,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西番诸夷方物多恶薄及乌思藏入贡违期诗以示之","author":"郭之奇","text":"流沙非不远，鞭箠在阶堂。\n西旅能通道，氐羌自享王。\n薄来虽有训，职贡本无忘。\n自古咸宾日，何时失献方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35270,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与朝鲜贡使","author":"郭之奇","text":"独念间关苦，劳来出至尊。\n蠢奴方绝命，尔国旧同伦。\n普率思王土，梯航亦圣恩。\n但无忘远服，自可世维藩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鲜使以皇华石洲二集求序兼乞余诗文稿书以答之","author":"郭之奇","text":"著书依北阙，问字及东夷。\n八则传箕后，同文入盛时。\n未飞司马檄，能诵大苏词。\n海外多声教，归求自有师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汶上阻雨　甲戌册荆藩道中作","author":"郭之奇","text":"朝云行岫出，暝雨向林深。\n乍喜红尘退，还愁绿野沉。\n前车迷屡望，后骑未闻音。\n惟有孤村火，遥悬失路心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邹邑道中雨过晓望","author":"郭之奇","text":"晨郊收宿雨，晓望出馀清。\n野意参差碧，山容近远明。\n苔浮生日厚，草湿受风轻。\n更觉含烟柳，离披似客情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚眺","author":"郭之奇","text":"骋目清郊际，轻阴拂道周。\n山容兼野澹，林影入村幽。\n万象空烟合，孤霞夕丽流。\n繇来多晚兴，此际倍悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":35275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]